stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> open: Glue cannot decide safely (one open item per order and operation)
    open --> acting: decision
    acting --> decided: done (a failed action opens a fresh item)
    acting --> open: restart, action still applies
    acting --> resolved: restart, order moved on
    open --> resolved: order got there another way
    decided --> [*]
    resolved --> [*]
